uthored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-23T20:28:33Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "146c26b49d30e6e0b6c7826e658c5734713a1528", "message": "Remove --no-warnings from test script\n\nUpdate package.json test script to remove the `--no-warnings` Node flag so warnings will be printed during test runs. The script still uses `--experimental-strip-types` and runs test/test.ts.", "created_at": "2026-02-23T20:21:03Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a1fc664d9785effc62a53174e632fdbd900730c1", "message": "Strip HTML tags in CLI output for readable plain text\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-23T20:18:42Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e53a336c719e12782c48fdf22615b728be9d9f82", "message": "Rewrite example in TypeScript, remove example.js\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-23T20:12:27Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "77e3d4554de8a70e1b82908503cabf52965b7e7e", "message": "Add ManifestItem interface, improve typing for flow/manifest/spine\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-23T20:07:08Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ceabe30bfcb8b0d671b68ade7c81f49e7f30ab46", "message": "Simplify rootfile lookup and fix type casts in asArray calls\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-23T19:54:10Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1231bdc6d8c6461afcd5b29a75ae3c2d0001ef76", "message": "Add CLI entry point for npx usage\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-23T19:25:46Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "229abfb3914a606e7970b7b9ab54b1a859cfef1d", "message": "Replace adm-zip with jszip, upgrade @types/node\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-23T19:17:41Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e9a3926af7012d54e89d33b0fe79a8b6a999168c", "message": "modernize README", "created_at": "2026-02-23T19:00:07Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d4847149dd172e6f8db2153b0f165895bed2ec60", "message": "Remove EventEmitter, convert all APIs to async/await\n\n- EPub no longer extends EventEmitter; parse() is now async\n- getChapter, getChapterRaw, getImage, getFile, readFile all return Promises\n- ZipLike.readFile returns Promise<Buffer> directly\n- Update tests, example, and README accordingly\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-23T18:54:43Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "59d6f6d8f8569f9ca26d727680399929b8f55c4d", "message": "Replace Travis CI and CircleCI with GitHub Actions (#64)\n\n* Replace Travis CI and CircleCI with GitHub Actions\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Empty commit\n\n* Update CI badge from Travis CI to GitHub Actions\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-23T18:45:46Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8177f642f9da633034bbcfc2dec7f68de052488a", "message": "npm run lint", "created_at": "2026-02-23T18:33:28Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "992a7479387ce5cb8248e9ac44b627928ed47823", "message": "Fix casing of EPUB in package description\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-23T18:31:55Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d5a5eb940fa057737cc83117e6e9adb6f49d3067", "message": "Add VS Code settings for oxfmt format-on-save\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-23T18:29:03Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b3ab55bd48710782722f67e5ee68257e7affb523", "message": "Add oxlint and oxfmt for linting and formatting TypeScript files\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-23T18:28:26Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f1e5e27450209a0cb6a7e5d5e7efb522ca41dabe", "message": "Rewrite epub parser in TypeScript with async/await (#63)\n\n* Rewrite epub.js \u2192 epub.ts for modern Node with --strip-types\n\n- Replace CommonJS epub.js with fully typed ESM epub.ts\n- Async/await internally instead of callback chains with .bind(this)\n- Drop separate epub.d.ts (types are inline now)\n- Drop tsconfig.json (no compile step needed)\n- Drop optional native zipfile dep, use adm-zip only\n- Tests use node:test instead of mocha, run directly via strip-types\n- Bump to v2.0.0, require Node >= 22.6.0\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01HBVjLBNKciUVu3tdRWfpCz\n\n* Replace xml2js with fast-xml-parser\n\n- xml2js is unmaintained (last release 2023); fast-xml-parser has 2x the\n  downloads and is actively maintained\n- Use XMLValidator.validate() for strict parsing (catches invalid XML\n  that fast-xml-parser's lenient parser would accept)\n- Cleaner attribute access: flat `@_attr` prefix instead of `[\"@\"][\"attr\"]`\n- Add textOf/attrsOf/asArray helpers to eliminate repetitive casting\n- Sync parsing (no more Promise wrapper around event-based parser)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01HBVjLBNKciUVu3tdRWfpCz\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-02-23T18:15:37Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c6bbe78c63732c40ff70a9160d0c5f00b874c475", "message": "1.3.0", "created_at": "2025-01-17T22:04:21Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4fc7b77598fed2cd1c1a3ac082b6df0ce6b1fc28", "message": "[ci] run npm -g as sudo", "created_at": "2018-10-03T16:49:15Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5f805fa34521094c8f9d919c643869dc57a6473b", "message": "Setup circleci", "created_at": "2018-10-03T16:43:58Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fbd3111517c483f22a5dcd391db752fe0f59b4e6", "message": "1.1.0", "created_at": "2018-09-28T19:26:05Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "65a2fc1b0cad1186c223c4b857749f351aed9158", "message": "Add travis badge to readme", "created_at": "2018-09-28T18:41:30Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "addc4c85334b2b9da6e85283c363fd814f508d78", "message": "[ci] npm ci", "created_at": "2018-09-28T18:20:07Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "949c7edd1cae9d1354ea7f0ccb30324674b82495", "message": "[ci] tsc", "created_at": "2018-09-28T18:16:57Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "835624c00f21dbf5d173f710f852155049016ad1", "message": "[ci] use node latest", "created_at": "2018-09-28T18:13:00Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4a173cf5745e3a3ca91c722e3081c65f09ebbe55", "message": "0.3.0", "created_at": "2018-09-28T16:35:10Z", "repo": "epub", "file_sampled